WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.899
Metro City Grand Hotel was hosting a fancy party.

2
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.154
All of Metro City's richest people were there.

3
00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:27.157
"What a lovely party!" said a woman with a diamond necklace.

4
00:00:27.158 --> 00:00:30.179
"Yes, it is," said another woman.

5
00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:33.728
She had a large ruby pinned to her dress.

6
00:00:33.729 --> 00:00:38.465
Suddenly there was a loud noise. Rumble! Rumble!

7
00:00:38.466 --> 00:00:41.639
"I hear motorcycles," said a man.

8
00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.996
A bolt of electricity flashed.

9
00:00:43.997 --> 00:00:47.071
Zap! The lights went out.

10
00:00:47.072 --> 00:00:51.594
When they came back on, everyone screamed.

11
00:00:51.595 --> 00:00:58.712
"Our jewelry!" a woman cried. "Someone stole it!"

12
00:00:58.713 --> 00:01:03.985
"Wow!" said Jack. "I can see Mars perfectly!"

13
00:01:03.986 --> 00:01:06.912
Roxy and her friends were in Jack's backyard.

14
00:01:06.913 --> 00:01:09.687
They were using Jack's new telescope.

15
00:01:09.688 --> 00:01:12.614
"Can I have a turn now?" asked Mara.

16
00:01:12.615 --> 00:01:14.681
"Sure," said Jack.

17
00:01:14.682 --> 00:01:17.855
He stepped back and let Mara look through the telescope.

18
00:01:17.856 --> 00:01:23.194
"I see Mars!" she said. "It's red and rocky!"

19
00:01:23.195 --> 00:01:27.371
"Do you see any Martians?" Terrell laughed.

20
00:01:27.372 --> 00:01:29.787
"Ha-ha!" Mara laughed too.

21
00:01:29.788 --> 00:01:32.541
"I don't see any Martians!"

22
00:01:32.542 --> 00:01:35.113
Jack opened a book about space.

23
00:01:35.114 --> 00:01:38.033
"Let's try to find this galaxy next!"

24
00:01:38.034 --> 00:01:41.417
He pointed to a colorful picture.

25
00:01:41.418 --> 00:01:43.547
"Cool!" said Terrell.

26
00:01:43.548 --> 00:01:46.426
"First we have to find it on your star chart."

27
00:01:46.427 --> 00:01:49.045
Terrell unfolded the star chart.

28
00:01:49.046 --> 00:01:51.582
Roxy leaned in to look.

29
00:01:51.583 --> 00:01:55.541
"We need to look between those two stars," she said.

30
00:01:55.542 --> 00:01:58.893
Roxy pointed to two bright stars on the chart.

31
00:01:58.894 --> 00:02:01.050
"Okay," said Jack.

32
00:02:01.051 --> 00:02:03.792
He spotted the two stars in the sky.

33
00:02:03.793 --> 00:02:06.720
Mara turned the telescope toward the stars.

34
00:02:06.721 --> 00:02:10.714
"It would be so cool to be an astronaut," she said.

35
00:02:10.715 --> 00:02:13.996
"I would love to go into space in a rocket!"

36
00:02:13.997 --> 00:02:17.220
"Astronauts are cool," said Terrell.

37
00:02:17.221 --> 00:02:20.424
"But you know who's even cooler than an astronaut?"

38
00:02:20.425 --> 00:02:24.668
"Let me guess," said Roxy. "Rocket Girl."

39
00:02:24.669 --> 00:02:27.347
"Yeah!" Terrell grinned.

40
00:02:27.348 --> 00:02:31.278
"An astronaut needs a rocket to fly in space.

41
00:02:31.279 --> 00:02:35.201
But Rocket Girl can fly in space without one."

42
00:02:35.202 --> 00:02:39.774
"Well, I think astronauts are pretty cool anyway," said Roxy.

43
00:02:39.775 --> 00:02:42.178
Terrell's eyes lit up.

44
00:02:42.179 --> 00:02:46.138
"Maybe Rocket Girl is flying through space right now!

45
00:02:46.139 --> 00:02:49.268
We should try to find her with the telescope!"

46
00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:54.564
Roxy laughed. "I don't think Rocket Girl is up there right now."

47
00:02:54.565 --> 00:02:57.246
Just then her watch beeped.

48
00:02:57.247 --> 00:03:07.490
She stepped away from her friends.

49
00:03:07.491 --> 00:03:12.135
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered. "Is there a problem?"

50
00:03:12.136 --> 00:03:14.827
"Yes, Rocket Girl," said the mayor.

51
00:03:14.828 --> 00:03:17.116
"There's a terrible problem!

52
00:03:17.117 --> 00:03:20.322
Someone has robbed the jewelry convention!

53
00:03:20.323 --> 00:03:26.891
All the jewels—diamonds, rubies, pearls—they were all stolen!"

54
00:03:26.892 --> 00:03:29.425
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

55
00:03:29.426 --> 00:03:35.862
"Rocket Girl will find the thief!"
